  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AI for anti corruption</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AI f&#xf6;r antikorruption</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Resurscentret kring antikorruption, U4 p&#xe5; Christian Michelsen Institute, g&#xf6;r en studie om m&#xf6;jligheterna f&#xf6;r och riskerna kring anv&#xe4;ndande av artificiell intelligens (AI) i arbetet mot korruption.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The resource centre on anti-corruption, U4 at Christian Michelsen Institute, is doing a study on the opportunities for and risk related to using Artificial Intelligence (AI) in the work against corruption. The study is expected to result in documented knowledge about current research findings, experiences and lessons learned from AI-initiatives in anti-corruption, and opportunities for and risks related to using AI in anti-corruption work in partner countries, partner organizations and in the portfolios of development agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
